  m_text: "You are a Dwarf \u2014 a race who loves metal and craft.\r\nDwarves often
    live with humans and even marry them, so not all Dwarves are short.\r\nMany are
    goldsmiths, bankers, or blacksmiths.\nThey are often quiet and reserved, but
    can create metalworks that amaze the world.\r\n"
