  m_text: "You are a Sylph \u2014 the most mysterious race.\r\nSylphs are close friends
    with Mages, but when meeting other races, they always wear large masks to cover
    their faces.\r\nPeople say Sylphs have weird or wild personalities.\r\nSome love
    jokes and fun, called \u201CHappy Sylphs.\u201D\r\nSome are quiet and calm, called
    \u201CSad Sylphs.\u201D\nYou are:"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd05e071760aa4846a9c6b649caa449f, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1292061209535636025, guid: bd05e071760aa4846a9c6b649caa449f, type: 2}
