  m_text: "You are an Elf \u2014 a well-known and kind-hearted race.\r\nElves live
    deep in forests \u2014 though that\u2019s mostly because they\u2019re allergic
    to the outside air.\r\nThey are curious, especially about human society, and
    possess enchanting singing voices and unmatched archery skills.\r\nThey are kind,
    passionate, and always wear a bright smile.\r\n"
