      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "You are a Vampire \u2014 a race that lives in the night.\r\nElegant, proud,
    and immortal, you live in castles in the mountains.\r\nVampires rarely talk to
    other races, mostly because they feel superior.\r\nYou don\u2019t need blood
    to live, but it tastes amazing to you."
