  m_text: "You are a Mage \u2014 still human, but with a curse.\r\nThis curse changes
    how you see the world.\r\nOther species often find Mages strange or hard to get
    along with.However, Mages often excel in the fields they love, and they tend
    to support one another, occasionally holding coven gatherings.\r\n"
